[13.92184, "o", "Expected output format in detection_results.json:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ```json\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> [\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   {\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     \"text\": \"input text\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
