[176.412926, "o", "tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('/app/merged_model/')\r\nmodel.eval()\r\n\r\n# Verify results match\r\nwith open('/app/detection_results.json') as f:\r\n    results = json.load(f)\r\n\r\nexpected = {\r\n    'fr': 6, 'es': 5, 'de': 2, 'it': 8, 'pt': 12,\r\n    'ru': 13, 'ja': 9, 'zh': 19, 'ar': 0, 'en': 4\r\n}\r\nlangs = ['fr', 'es', 'de', 'it', 'pt', 'ru', 'ja', 'zh', 'ar', 'en']\r\n\r\ncorrect = 0\r\nfor i, r in enumerate(results):\r\n    lang = langs[i]\r\n    exp = expected[lang]\r\n    match = r['predicted_class_id'] == exp\r\n    if match:\r\n        correct += 1\r\n    print(f'{lang}: predicted={r[\\\"predicted_class_id\\\"]}, expected={exp}, match={match}, conf={r[\\\"confidence\\\"]}')\r\n\r\nprint(f'\\nAccuracy: {correct}/{len(results)} = {correct/len(results)*100:.0f}%')\r\n\" 2>&1 — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash python3 -c \" import json, torch from transformers import AutoTokenizer…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 16 tool call(s) so far\r\nAll 10 test samples are correctly classified at 100% accuracy. Here's a summary of what was done:\r\n\r"]
[176.413038, "o", "\n**Completed steps:**\r\n\r\n1. **Base model downloaded** — `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` loaded from HuggingFace\r\n2. **LoRA adapter downloaded** — `dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection` loaded and applied\r\n3. **Configured for 20 languages** — `num_labels=20` set on the base model (the adapter was trained with 20 language classes: ar, bg, de, el, en, es, fr, hi, it, ja, nl, pl, pt, ru, sw, th, tr, ur, vi, zh)\r\n4. **Saved to `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/`** — configured model + tokenizer\r\n5. **LoRA adapter applied** — via `PeftModel.from_pretrained`\r\n6. **Merged and saved to `/app/merged_model/`** — LoRA weights merged into base model via `merge_and_unload()`\r\n7. **Test results saved to `/app/detection_results.json`** — all 10 samples correctly classified (100% accuracy), with confidences ranging from 0.936 to 0.997\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=16 surface=48cd0ade3676\r\n"]
